WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:17.136
a pretty awesome wipeout!"

2
00:00:18.197 --> 00:00:20.699
Riley looked up from where she was lying on the grass.

3
00:00:21.779 --> 00:00:25.482
Quinn Evans stood above her, holding out a bottle of water.

4
00:00:25.502 --> 00:00:29.005
"Thirsty?" "Thanks."

5
00:00:29.746 --> 00:00:32.188
Riley took the water and gulped down about half of it.

6
00:00:37.748 --> 00:00:39.669
"Yeah, I wiped out alright.

7
00:00:40.269 --> 00:00:41.729
I'm waiting for my mom to come.

8
00:00:42.229 --> 00:00:44.250
I think I need to get my ankle x-rayed."

9
00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:47.291
"Bummer," Quinn said.

10
00:00:47.311 --> 00:00:50.992
"My second run was three seconds faster than my first one.

11
00:00:51.812 --> 00:00:53.792
That's definitely good enough to make the team.

12
00:00:54.633 --> 00:00:58.434
I guess you're not going to be able to test the trail again today."

13
00:00:59.794 --> 00:01:00.734
Riley frowned.

14
00:01:01.575 --> 00:01:06.236
Maybe it was her imagination, but Quinn sounded almost pleased about Riley's fall.

15
00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:10.101
Just then Coach Adams hurried over.

16
00:01:10.121 --> 00:01:13.903
"Hey, Coach Adams!"

17
00:01:14.724 --> 00:01:15.564
Quinn burst out.

18
00:01:15.584 --> 00:01:18.026
"Did you see my time on that last run?

19
00:01:18.666 --> 00:01:20.547
I'm going to make a great Blue Demon!"

20
00:01:21.488 --> 00:01:22.648
The coach smiled at her.

21
00:01:22.668 --> 00:01:26.510
"If you repeat that time next weekend, you'll be doing well, Quinn."

22
00:01:27.671 --> 00:01:29.192
She tossed her head and smiled.

23
00:01:29.212 --> 00:01:31.953
"I need to talk to Riley for a minute, okay?"

24
00:01:32.354 --> 00:01:33.234
Coach Adams said.

25
00:01:34.475 --> 00:01:35.155
Quinn shrugged.

26
00:01:35.175 --> 00:01:38.161
"Sure, Coach," she said, walking away.

27
00:01:41.003 --> 00:01:43.345
Coach dropped onto the grass beside Riley.

28
00:01:43.365 --> 00:01:46.888
"How is the ankle?"

29
00:01:46.908 --> 00:01:52.112
"At least I'm not on a stretcher heading for the hospital," Riley said.

30
00:01:53.233 --> 00:01:57.857
She was trying to sound light and unconcerned, but instead her voice was tense.

31
00:01:57.877 --> 00:02:02.861
"It's not going to happen to you, you know," Coach Adams said quietly.

32
00:02:02.881 --> 00:02:07.636
"It wasn't supposed to happen to Jordan either," Riley said.

33
00:02:07.656 --> 00:02:12.038
"Nobody breaks a leg in four places, and gets a compound fracture.

34
00:02:12.778 --> 00:02:16.359
Jordan's injury was a one-in-a-million kind, according to the doctors."

35
00:02:16.379 --> 00:02:19.360
"Terrible things do happen sometimes.

36
00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:22.521
I've seen all kinds of injuries on the track."

37
00:02:23.141 --> 00:02:24.281
Coach Adams paused.

38
00:02:24.301 --> 00:02:29.523
"But you can't let fear, or Jordan's accident, affect your riding.

39
00:02:30.343 --> 00:02:31.663
Falling is part of the sport.

40
00:02:32.523 --> 00:02:34.024
Your fall today isn't a big deal."

41
00:02:34.924 --> 00:02:37.366
But the fall was a big deal to Riley.

42
00:02:38.267 --> 00:02:39.808
Blowing the jump wasn't the problem.

43
00:02:40.729 --> 00:02:43.991
Blowing her concentration and making stupid mistakes was.

44
00:02:44.972 --> 00:02:47.114
She couldn't let her mind drift away from the track.

45
00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:53.399
Ever since Jordan's accident, Riley had tried hard not to let jumps spook her.

46
00:02:54.059 --> 00:02:55.701
But sometimes it was impossible.

47
00:02:56.701 --> 00:03:00.504
And whenever she remembered Jordan's accident, it rattled her confidence.

48
00:03:01.385 --> 00:03:04.267
Just then Quinn rode past on her Fleet HD3.

49
00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:11.082
Riley and Coach Adams watched Quinn hit the track again.

50
00:03:11.803 --> 00:03:15.085
Her head was low, and she looked confident and skilled.

51
00:03:16.386 --> 00:03:20.990
"She's probably going to get one of the spots in the girls' junior division," Riley said.

52
00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:25.013
"You know what can be helpful when you need to focus?"

53
00:03:25.653 --> 00:03:27.194
Coach Adams said casually.

54
00:03:28.235 --> 00:03:31.438
Riley looked at him, ready to get any advice she could.

55
00:03:31.458 --> 00:03:34.280
"What?" He stood up.

56
00:03:36.356 --> 00:03:38.918
"Some good, old-fashioned competition.

57
00:03:39.598 --> 00:03:40.639
See you later, Riley.

58
00:03:41.119 --> 00:03:42.260
Good luck with the x-rays."

59
00:03:44.041 --> 00:03:47.844
Riley spent the afternoon at a walk-in clinic, having her ankle x-rayed.

60
00:03:52.687 --> 00:03:57.130
Just as Delaney had suspected, it wasn't broken, only sprained.

61
00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:59.952
"Will I be able to ride next Saturday?"

62
00:04:00.513 --> 00:04:02.154
Riley asked the doctor anxiously.

63
00:04:02.174 --> 00:04:05.096
"I'm supposed to try out for the Blue Demons team."

64
00:04:06.192 --> 00:04:09.814
"If you take it easy this week, I don't see why not," the doctor said.

65
00:04:09.834 --> 00:04:14.616
"Use ice packs to reduce the swelling, and be sure to keep your ankle elevated.

66
00:04:15.196 --> 00:04:16.596
You should be fine in a few days."

67
00:04:16.616 --> 00:04:18.537
"Did you hear that?"

68
00:04:19.038 --> 00:04:20.958
Mrs. Clark said, eyeing her daughter.

69
00:04:20.978 --> 00:04:23.159
"You've got to take it easy."

70
00:04:23.179 --> 00:04:25.420
"No worries, Mom.

71
00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.061
I'll be an angel."

72
00:04:28.782 --> 00:04:29.982
Riley's mom chuckled.

73
00:04:30.002 --> 00:04:37.165
"That'll be a first, sweetheart," she said, helping Riley hobble out of the exam room.

74
00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:45.809
For the next two days, Riley sat on the couch, icing her ankle and planning her winning strategy

75
00:04:45.869 --> 00:04:47.329
for next weekend's tryout.

76
00:04:47.349 --> 00:04:53.632
"Part one of my strategy is to get to the gym," she thought.

77
00:04:54.533 --> 00:04:57.994
She wanted to exercise her ankle and strengthen her leg muscles.

78
00:04:59.014 --> 00:05:02.156
Part two of her plan would be a lot more challenging.

79
00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:05.622
Her parents agreed to the gym idea.

80
00:05:05.642 --> 00:05:09.205
"That works well with our schedule too," Mr.

81
00:05:09.225 --> 00:05:09.785
Clark said.

82
00:05:09.805 --> 00:05:13.428
"You can meet Mom at the gym after school and do your thing.

83
00:05:14.209 --> 00:05:15.990
I'll take Jordan to physical therapy."

84
00:05:16.891 --> 00:05:22.276
On Tuesday afternoon after school, Riley's father picked her up and drove to the YMCA.

85
00:05:25.738 --> 00:05:29.261
Jordan was in the backseat with her crutches, playing games on her phone.

86
00:05:29.281 --> 00:05:35.009
"You'll meet Mom at the front desk," Dad instructed Riley as he parked out front.

87
00:05:35.029 --> 00:05:38.310
"Did you remember your membership card and all the forms?"

88
00:05:39.851 --> 00:05:41.232
Riley patted her backpack.

89
00:05:42.572 --> 00:05:43.173
"Right here."

90
00:05:43.193 --> 00:05:45.373
"And your ankle feels okay?"

91
00:05:45.393 --> 00:05:48.275
"It feels fine, Dad.

92
00:05:48.475 --> 00:05:49.195
I promise."

93
00:05:50.095 --> 00:05:51.376
Riley took a deep breath.

94
00:05:55.558 --> 00:05:58.839
Now it was time to put part two of the plan into action.

95
00:05:58.859 --> 00:06:03.390
"Dad," she blurted out before she could lose her nerve.

96
00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:08.434
"Did you know there are only two open spots for girls in the Blue Demons' junior division?"

97
00:06:08.454 --> 00:06:11.517
"No." He looked surprised.

98
00:06:12.338 --> 00:06:14.219
"I think you'll get one of them, sweetheart.

99
00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:16.161
You're a very skilled rider."

100
00:06:16.181 --> 00:06:22.146
"I'd be better, though," Riley went on, "if I had that new bike."

101
00:06:23.287 --> 00:06:26.390
Riley's parents had promised to help her buy a new bike this year.

102
00:06:27.151 --> 00:06:31.438
But after Jordan's accident, Riley's new bike was no longer a priority.

103
00:06:32.539 --> 00:06:38.043
On top of all the worry about Jordan's broken leg, medical bills kept coming and coming.

104
00:06:38.064 --> 00:06:42.587
"There's a really good new rider in my division," Riley said.

105
00:06:44.389 --> 00:06:47.351
She told her father about Quinn's expensive new bike.

106
00:06:47.371 --> 00:06:52.015
"I know we agreed that I would wait till summer for mine," she finished.

107
00:06:52.035 --> 00:06:56.599
"But maybe you guys could lend me the money now, before the tryout?

108
00:06:57.379 --> 00:06:59.232
Please?" Mr.

109
00:06:59.272 --> 00:07:00.914
Clark's smile had disappeared.

110
00:07:00.934 --> 00:07:06.317
"You definitely deserve a new bike," he said slowly.

111
00:07:07.118 --> 00:07:08.179
Riley's heart jumped.

112
00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:13.502
"But it's out of the question right now," he went on.

113
00:07:13.522 --> 00:07:22.269
"Once Jordan's medical bills are paid off, then maybe It was the answer she expected, but it still

114
00:07:22.349 --> 00:07:26.712
hurt. Riley slumped into the seat, fighting to keep back tears.

115
00:07:29.044 --> 00:07:31.225
"I know it's not fair," Mr.

116
00:07:31.265 --> 00:07:31.866
Clark said.

117
00:07:31.886 --> 00:07:34.967
"But it's the way it is right now."

118
00:07:34.987 --> 00:07:39.730
"I'm really sorry, Riley," Jordan said softly.

119
00:07:41.671 --> 00:07:44.673
Without a word Riley grabbed her backpack and jumped out of the car.

120
00:07:46.994 --> 00:07:48.515
Her mother was waiting in the lobby.

121
00:07:48.535 --> 00:07:50.376
"Hi, Riley.

122
00:07:50.636 --> 00:07:55.018
I Her words trailed off when she saw the stormy look on Riley's face.

123
00:07:55.038 --> 00:07:56.719
"What's the matter, honey?"

124
00:07:56.739 --> 00:07:59.792
"Nothing," Riley mumbled.

125
00:08:00.573 --> 00:08:03.934
Mrs. Clark looked hard at Riley but didn't ask any more questions.

126
00:08:04.874 --> 00:08:06.715
She just signed Riley in at the desk.

127
00:08:06.735 --> 00:08:11.856
"Be careful with that ankle," Mrs.

128
00:08:11.916 --> 00:08:12.517
Clark said.

129
00:08:12.537 --> 00:08:14.657
"I'm going to a yoga class.

130
00:08:15.097 --> 00:08:16.558
I'll meet you back here in an hour."

131
00:08:16.578 --> 00:08:19.579
"Fine," Riley muttered.

132
00:08:20.439 --> 00:08:22.260
And then she went off alone to work out.
